# Independent project (see Lab/README.md) — not an npm workspace, has its own
# install/run lifecycle.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Generated per run — STEP/STL/results.json are rebuilt from project.yaml + the
# domain's code, never hand-edited. See Lab/README.md / IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md on why
# these deliberately don't travel through the main pipe repo's git/parcel pipeline.
projects/*/export/
